      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4 warps \u00d7 4 lanes \u00d7 16 registers \u00d7 32 bits = 1 KB\nTwo 128-bit reads; one masked 128-bit write\nNormal reads use the selected warp; TMUL owns both read ports for four gather cycles\nDebug preload has priority over architectural writes",
      "originalText": "4 warps \u00d7 4 lanes \u00d7 16 registers \u00d7 32 bits = 1 KB\nTwo 128-bit reads; one masked 128-bit write\nNormal reads use the selected warp; TMUL owns both read ports for four gather cycles\nDebug preload has priority over architectural writes",
